        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(searxng): fail closed on unresolved base url refs",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nSearXNG lets users configure `plugins.entries.searxng.config.webSearch.baseUrl` as a SecretRef. When that configured SecretRef could not be resolved locally, runtime resolution could still fall through to the ambient `SEARXNG_BASE_URL` environment variable. That could silently route web_search requests to a different SearXNG host than the explicitly configured one.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nConfigured credential-like values should either resolve to the configured target or fail closed. This keeps the SearXNG base URL contract aligned with provider-local SecretRef behavior: ambient env fallback is only for the unconfigured case, not for a configured-but-unavailable SecretRef.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers with a valid configured string or env SecretRef keep the same behavior. Users with no configured baseUrl can still rely on `SEARXNG_BASE_URL`. Users with an unavailable configured SecretRef now get an unavailable SearXNG base URL instead of silently using an unrelated ambient endpoint.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Added local config matrix coverage for configured string precedence, ambient-env fallback when unconfigured, env SecretRef resolution, missing env SecretRef fail-closed behavior, non-env SecretRef fail-closed behavior, and malformed baseUrl handling.\n- Updated `docs/tools/searxng-search.md` so the documented resolution order matches the runtime contract.\n- Collision check before edits found no live open PR touching `extensions/searxng/src/config.ts` or the new `extensions/searxng/src/config.test.ts`. Related #104216 touches SearXNG client/provider abort handling, not this config resolver.\n\n## Proof\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/searxng/src/config.test.ts extensions/searxng/src/searxng-search-provider.test.ts` passed, 14 tests.\n- `node_modules/.bin/oxfmt --check extensions/searxng/src/config.ts extensions/searxng/src/config.test.ts docs/tools/searxng-search.md` passed.\n- `node_modules/.bin/oxlint extensions/searxng/src/config.ts extensions/searxng/src/config.test.ts` passed.\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD` passed.\n- `node scripts/docs-list.js` passed.\n- Local autoreview via Claude passed with no accepted/actionable findings before commit; a post-commit local run reported no local changes to review.\n",
        "branch": "llagy007/searxng-secretref-fail-closed-20260712",
